  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk14:0.5": "tatiya sikkhāpadaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk14:1.0": "8. 2. 4. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk14:1.1": "sāvatthinidānaṃ – ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk14:1.2": "tena kho pana samayena chabbaggiyā bhikkhū uccāsaddaṃ mahāsaddaṃ karontā antaraghare nisīdanti. …pe… ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk14:1.3.0": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk14:1.3.1": "appasaddo antaraghare nisīdissāmīti sikkhā karaṇīyā’ti. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk14:1.4": "appasaddena antaraghare nisīditabbaṃ, ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk14:1.5": "yo anādariyaṃ paṭicca uccāsaddaṃ mahāsaddaṃ karonto antaraghare nisīdati āpatti dukkaṭassa. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk14:1.6.0": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk14:1.6.1": "anāpatti: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk14:1.7.1": "asañcicca …pe… ",
